    title: "rust: a call to an extern-block declaration is classified by no catalogue; its ffi_import binding (C ABI, wasm_bindgen js_namespace) names the foreign catalogue that could classify it (loro's Date.now host_info_read now unreported)"  # cc1b
    status: todo_hard  # cc1b
